<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Statistics of the ProactiveMobile dataset, broken down by Train and Test splits and data modality. The table details the composition of our benchmark, including the number of scenes, items, intents, functions, and distribution of different difficulties. Notably, the test set includes two additional scenes (14 vs. 12) not present in the training set, which form our dedicated out-of-distribution (OOD) evaluation split.</figcaption>
